  "worked_solution": "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x}^{2}+x-2 \\\\  & {x}^{2}+2x-1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,{x}^{4}+3{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}-5x+4\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{{x}^{4}+2{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}}_{\u2015} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}-5x+4 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}-x}_{\u2015} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2{x}^{2}-4x+4 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,2{x}^{2}-4x+2}_{\u2015} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result,\n\n- the quotient is ${x}^{2}+x-2,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $2.$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{4}+3{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}-5x+4}{{x}^{2}+2x-1}={x}^{2}+x-2+\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}+2x-1}.\n$$",
